  <item>
    <title>vol.12 社招大揭秘，岗位JD里暗藏的求职方法论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68591a272a38b4d9791693d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68591a272a38b4d9791693d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>求职专题：社招篇</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期以“社招”为主题，邀请到我们新的合作伙伴Dewi来一起聊一聊现在的社招市场——为什么感觉工作越来越难找。同时通过两个具体的在招职位信息，来剖析下我们看到的岗位JD，到底可以传达给求职者什么信息。</span></p><span></span><p><span>全集多处穿插非常实际的求职和面试方法论，大家一定要仔细收听哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dewi，猎头，企业HR</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图文素材】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuHye6t27-qf8vRxgoxjlqYYP6dX.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsEl403EB4pFbNN_agi6z_EvtABk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 好久不见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 社招市场感知分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> HR视角剖析现在社招中企业更看重什么样的人才</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 关于AI在职场中的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 岗位JD有哪些特点和变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 在面试前我们应该做哪些准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> 岗位JD拆解实例，职场人对于JD的感知是怎么样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 职场人如何看岗位JD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> HR大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a> 岗位职责和任职要求有什么区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 什么叫做好工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> 职位中的薪酬有哪些信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 盒子面试经验分享，岗位薪酬是否可以突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> 故事分享，出现这种情况就要小心了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，边缘探险全新系列已上线，欢迎对于求职有问题，有想法，有经验的小伙伴 来互动~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmnxd7n2ZHGHvBZRISfogKHbCKTk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
