  <item>
    <title>vol.10 聊聊展会丨打工人的梦窝，“艺术家”的跑马场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6830545434e14d90d696826c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6830545434e14d90d696826c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>行业系列——展览/展会</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>XX展和XX会，是主播们一起喝下午茶时候碰出来的话题，大家有一个共同的问题就是，他们在干什么？随之而来的就是：为什么要这么做？好处又是什么？带着这些疑问，邀请到了前策展人，现影视策划小宁和展销会资深参展商高嵩，一起来聊聊“展会行业你以为的和你不知道的”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一次策展是一次艺术创作吗？博物馆想让你看什么？展销会值不值得去？婚博会上的人真的是都要结婚吗？带着你的问题和我们一起进入「边缘探险」行业系列的第二弹~</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾有主播嘉宾亲测推荐的博物馆和展销会，欢迎大家在评论区互动留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宁，影视策划，前策展人，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a1ff01e09c8525a694dd50"><span>《小宁的创业圈》</span></a><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>高嵩，婚礼行业从业者，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60c972100000000001002263?xsec_token=YBSUMuJL4wUc6DTSLoNwSDfqslGMQ6SwpV1LjNZ_NYJZs%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1747993708&amp;share_id=e24f05e2096e447285fb1700dc761adc&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60c972100000000001002263?xsec_token=YBSUMuJL4wUc6DTSLoNwSDfqslGMQ6SwpV1LjNZ_NYJZs%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1747993708&amp;share_id=e24f05e2096e447285fb1700dc761adc&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>北京合声婚礼主理人</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 1 博物馆和展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">00:02:55</a> &nbsp;前从业者小宁的背景介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">00:06:00</a> 博物馆其实是一个项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">00:08:07</a> 策展人工作内容揭秘，那些你不知道的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">00:10:15</a> &nbsp;策展是艺术创作还是自我表达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">00:11:38</a> &nbsp;博物馆的叙事方式其实很普通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">00:14:56</a> 你所看到的=想让你看到的=银子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">00:17:57</a> 博物馆热是真的热吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">00:24:53</a> 展品来自哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">00:27:11</a> &nbsp;策展工作的收获分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">00:31:16</a> 公益展览和艺术展览谁更赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2079">00:34:39</a> 主题和受众来自哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">00:37:42</a> 该怎么去看展</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 2 展会和展销会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">00:38:52</a> 聊聊展销会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">00:40:20</a> &nbsp;从工作人员到参展老板的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2871">00:47:51</a> &nbsp;展销会拼的是价格还是品质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2953">00:49:13</a> &nbsp;展销会中各方的得与失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">00:52:21</a> &nbsp;什么？去婚博会的也不一定是真情侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">00:56:24</a> &nbsp;to行业新人和观望者，展销会是个集中探店的好机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3666">01:01:06</a> &nbsp;大佬参与的论坛都在干什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3944">01:05:44</a> &nbsp;高层次论坛一般人可以参加嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">01:06:38</a> &nbsp;嘉宾主播推荐的展览和展会</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
