    <guid isPermaLink="false">6825fe8f5ccf03732b0ff2ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>填坑模拟面试（2）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次旁听别人的面试场景，作为上帝视角会产生了很多疑问和思考。面试官为什么要问这个问题，求职者怎么回答的更得体，我面试的时候也是这种表达方式吗？本期节目前所未有的为大家呈现一场真实的面试场景，让听众 边听边想边思考 ，希望能给大家带来一些灵感~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Skyler（找工作找她），「小羚不卷」资深HR，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>公司小红书主页&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>窝窝，应届毕业生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">00:01:22</a> 面试正式开始，请先做个自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">00:02:47</a> 针对你的介绍和简历内容，有几个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">00:05:02</a> 你觉得toc和tob有什么区别呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">00:08:13</a> &nbsp;为什么会选择所在的这家公司呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">00:10:12</a> &nbsp;这家公司的工作强度如何呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">00:12:24</a> &nbsp;HR常规的工作流程还有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">00:16:59</a> &nbsp;面试老手盒子上线，同样的问题我会怎么回答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">00:26:58</a> &nbsp;窝窝面试完自我复盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">00:29:48</a> &nbsp;面试官Skyler总结与点评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">00:34:34</a> &nbsp;这个事儿我不敢说真话</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐采样：陈卓璇《不期而遇》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
