    <guid isPermaLink="false">682174ebb7c8a9962ca164e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 04:20:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>填坑模拟面试（1）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这本来是为“模拟面试”热场子的环节，结果大家聊得太认真，太中肯，内容接地气又非常实用，所以也没有怎么剪，直接变成了面试经历分享大会。希望能够给你一些灵感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于时长原因本次话题分为上下期，重头戏会在下期更新，敬请期待~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Skyler（找工作找她），「小羚不卷」资深HR，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>公司小红书主页&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>窝窝，应届毕业生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">00:02:13</a> 面试经历分享，奇葩无语问题大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 盒子参加面试直接把公司hr聊跑了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">00:09:43</a> 小北依靠每天通勤3小时，拿下新工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">00:14:46</a> 巴瑞斯面试套公式，屡试不爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">00:19:39</a> 面试双方都清楚的程式化回答，其实也有必要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">00:25:36</a> 生活中的各种面试，我们要做一个面试普信者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">00:28:20</a> 快问快答变干货分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">00:28:47</a> 薪资满意内容不喜欢vs内容喜欢薪资不满意，该怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">00:39:00</a> 如何看待加班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">00:41:04</a> &nbsp;这个期望薪资真的很高吗？明明信息里这么写的啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2559">00:42:39</a> 你能给公司带来什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2957">00:49:17</a> &nbsp;工作经历和面试岗位不相关怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">00:53:45</a> &nbsp;面试结束之后的反问环节，我该说什么体面又有效</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
