    <pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>行业系列——机器人（下）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【上期回顾】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680d096f8aed253fa3adfe1e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680d096f8aed253fa3adfe1e"><span>vol.6 我的哆啦A梦在哪里？聊聊机器人行业（上）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>进入职业选择篇，聊一聊专业选择，交叉学科。然后就是长达30分钟开放杂谈，很精彩，节目里等你~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鱼，北京某机器人公司算法工程师，播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67cf94545b64cc8a84a9e0dc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67cf94545b64cc8a84a9e0dc"><span>《常话常新》</span></a><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:00:16</a> 对于外行人该如何进入机器人行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">00:04:11</a> 有真正前景好的专业吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">00:09:27</a> 越来越多的交叉领域，基础学科是不变的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">00:10:46</a> &nbsp;就业多年还能入行机器人嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">00:12:48</a> &nbsp;开放话题：机器人未来的发展趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">00:17:38</a> &nbsp;哪些职业会被机器人替代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">00:20:28</a> &nbsp;机器人大脑发展趋势，代替开发者自我开发？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">00:23:10</a> &nbsp;机器人的发展下，人与社会的伦理关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">00:25:52</a> I人想要的机器人是什么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">00:29:43</a> &nbsp;题外话：前端人员和研发者对谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">00:34:59</a> &nbsp;大家的热情才会促进一个行业的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">00:38:09</a> 人形机器人是个巨大骗局</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐采样：薛之谦《情书》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
