  <item>
    <title>vol.6 我的哆啦A梦在哪里？聊聊机器人行业（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680d096f8aed253fa3adfe1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680d096f8aed253fa3adfe1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>行业系列——机器人（上）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>亦庄半马一枪，直接把春晚舞台风光无限的“演员”打倒在起点？无所不能的超级英雄其实是蹒跚学步的小娃娃？这次与我们好朋友小鱼的对话，让他在把过年应付亲戚的一套话又说了一遍，也帮我们搭建起了和「哆啦A梦」的对话桥梁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鱼，北京某机器人公司算法工程师，播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67cf94545b64cc8a84a9e0dc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67cf94545b64cc8a84a9e0dc"><span>《常话常新》</span></a><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小北，盒子，巴瑞斯</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">00:01:47</a> &nbsp;全球首个人形机器人马拉松在北京鸣枪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">00:03:03</a> 小白眼中的机器人行业应该是无所不能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">00:05:17</a> &nbsp;科幻电影先入为主，认知不同源于视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">00:08:14</a> &nbsp;机器人行业两大困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">00:09:45</a> &nbsp;人形机器人“物种起源说”和“进化论”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">00:15:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;机器人研发路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">00:16:45</a> &nbsp;机器人和AI其实是一次社会进步中的美好相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">00:22:55</a> &nbsp;人形机器人大量曝光，有哪些信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">00:26:48</a> &nbsp;机器人行业商业模式？哪个环节最烧钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">00:32:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;机器人是噱头？行业龙头都靠什么赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">00:39:08</a> &nbsp;美区负责人开麦中美科技，世界前列还是要Made in China</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐采样：SoulFa 灵魂沙发《</span><em><span>Lover song</span></em><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
