  <item>
    <title>vol.5 Boss&amp;HR坦白局：gap是污点还是跳板？——空窗期自救指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6800c3021f1db84a56e1b709</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6800c3021f1db84a56e1b709</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>再谈gap期~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span><br><span>继续探讨Z世代对gap year的追捧与争议，在招聘现场捕捉HR和Boss的筛选逻辑，也在与职场人的对话中触摸他们的焦虑与突破。当gap year既是「人生刚需」又是职场争议点时，我们邀请HR专家Skyler与从gap中得到灵感的创始人财神，共同拆解这一现象背后的叙事逻辑：它究竟是职场履历的污点，还是人生转型的契机？</span><br><span> </span><br><span>Skyler以HR视角直言：「gap只是人生常态，技能才是硬通货。」财神则从创业者的角度调侃：「自由职业的成败，暴露了你的自律底线。」主播和他们的对话中也了解到了职场评价体系的多元性——外企重能力，国企求稳定，私企看价值创造。而双方的共识在于：gap的合理性取决于其「规划性」。被动裁员可理解，裸辞需谨慎；短期休息被接受，长期空白需技能弥补。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>职场从无标准答案，但每个选择都需智慧。gap year的真谛，或许在于如何将暂停键转化为跳板——毕竟，人生不是流水线，而是一场自定义的冒险。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Skyler（找工作找她），「小羚不卷」资深HR，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64120fbc0000000012013bc0?xsec_token=YBVXVi-R3ziW8iChk6yH1RrDqn0EMuKHOVnBLdEIG0goM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6301f7c3000000001501813c&amp;apptime=1744873406&amp;share_id=f5cf5ae61063437baf0197b0a3d903f0&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>公司小红书主页&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>财神（旅行找他），「济南新青年国旅」创始人/主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span><br><span>Part 1 Z世代的职场选择题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:00:23</a> Z世代视角：gap year是「人生刚需」还是职场风险？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">00:04:54</a> 打破偏见：gap year既非传奇亦非污点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">00:09:34</a> HR的隐形规则：gap时长如何影响招聘决策？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">00:20:14</a> 职场哲学：回头草需进步后再「嚼」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">00:28:36</a> 裸辞空窗期：高性价比充电指南</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">00:32:51</a> 追星与gap year：放松与放纵的界限</span><br><span> </span><br><span>Part 2 面试与跳槽的生存法则</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">00:33:34</a> 面试策略：经历包装与形象塑造的艺术</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">00:49:54</a> 从被动gap到主动转型：副业创造的职场奇迹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">00:54:52</a> 跳板公司：Z世代职业跃迁的隐藏路径</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3863">01:04:23</a> 大胆形象实验：职场印象管理的风险与机遇</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐采样：许冠杰</span><em><span>《财神到》</span></em><span>，韩宝仪</span><em><span>《迎财神接财神》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目投稿：GaborWells（添加备注「投稿」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：GaborWells（添加备注「听友群」）</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：边缘探险</span></p><span></span><p><span>「边缘探险」从自身出发，以小见大，持续以探讨人生经历和个人体验为切入点，每期关注不同的一件大事儿或者小事儿，感谢您的聆听~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67c3f54252721020b1d8e37b/lrVUN4RL_VTg0XLzqvFEKBW-IWeH.m4a" length="99382245" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFsZVER28baBzvcy4yiXakJkd7j.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
